<p style="color: white; margin-top: 15px !important; margin-bottom: 15px;">Gurucul Named a Visionary in 2022 Gartner® Magic Quadrant<sup style="top: -1.2em; font-size: 6.5px;">TM</sup> for SIEM. <em>Positioned Furthest to the Right for Completeness of Vision.</em></p>
