<h2 class="h1Title" style="text-shadow: #01202d 1px 1px 10px; font-weight: bold; text-align: left; line-height: 1.1; text-transform: uppercase; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 20px;">How the Gurucul Platform Works</h2>
<p style="color: #ffffff;">The Gurucul platform ingests, correlates, and normalizes all your data without the need for customization to reduce false positives. It automatically detects threats using advanced analytics and out-of-the-box threat content. By leveraging a trained machine learning engine, the platform provides context for targeted threat hunting and investigations. It applies an enterprise class risk engine for prioritizing and automating response actions.</p>

			</div>
